Package: servmanager
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: GitHub User <user@example.com>
Depends: python3, python3-pip, python3-venv, nodejs, npm, systemd
Description: ServManager Dashboard
 Powerful self-hosted web-based server administration dashboard 
 and remote control tool. Features real-time diagnostics, a port 
 scanner, script execution, and an automation workflow assembler.
